sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Remote as D-pad remote
    participant Focus as Focus-state model
    participant UI as 10-foot UI (rows/cards)
    participant Player as Media3 player (Ch 56/58)

    User->>Remote: press RIGHT
    Remote->>Focus: move focus spatially (next focusable right)
    Focus->>UI: update focus highlight (scale/glow) - visible at 10 feet
    User->>Remote: press SELECT
    Remote->>UI: activate focused card
    UI->>Player: play content (DRM license if premium, Ch 58)
    Player-->>UI: playing - leanback transport overlay (D-pad/media keys)
    User->>Remote: press PLAY/PAUSE (media key)
    Remote->>Player: transport control
    Note over Focus,UI: every element reachable, clear initial focus, no focus traps
